# Required for SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded ffmpeg.wasm) to work in the
# browser: the page must be "cross-origin isolated". Netlify serves this repo
# as a static export, so response headers are configured here rather than in
# next.config.ts (which `output: "export"` doesn't apply at the hosting
# layer). See src/lib/video-engine.ts's loadFFmpeg() for the matching
# crossOriginIsolated feature-detection + graceful single-thread fallback
# (older browsers / any host that can't set these headers still work, just
# without the multi-thread speedup).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
